Package: isw
Type: Package
Title: Model Stream Depletion and Aquifer Drawdown
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Gopal", "Penny", email = "gopalpenny@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prepares stream networks and models transient stream depletion,
    stream injection, and aquifer water-level change caused by groundwater
    pumping. Supports analytical depletion-function apportionment and a
    finite-line constant-head stream representation.
